OL,3,AFirst Glastonbury 2027 tickets sell out
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe first batch of tickets for
OL,6,FGlastonbury Festival have sold out in
OL,7,Fless than 30 minutes, according to the
OL,8,Forganisers.
OL,10,FThe event will take place from 23-27
OL,11,FJune 2027 at Worthy Farm in Pilton,
OL,12,FSomerset, after a fallow year in 2026.
OL,14,FCoach tickets have now sold out after
OL,15,Fless than half an hour, after going on
OL,16,Fsale at 18:00 BST on Thursday. General
OL,17,Fadmission tickets go on sale at 09:00
OL,18,FBST on Sunday morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
