OL,3,AFirst Glastonbury 2027 tickets sell out
OL,4,
OL,5,FJessi Dimmock from Glasto Cast, a
OL,6,Fpodcast covering the festival, said:
OL,7,F"It's the most stressful weekend of my
OL,8,Fyear. I'll be there Sunday morning with
OL,9,Fmy phone, my laptop, and my coffee and
OL,10,FI will be stressed."
